{
  "id": "584001",
  "resourceId": 840,
  "name": "艾達",
  "skin": "DRESS",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c840_02_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c840_02_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "我的身分？很抱歉，這是祕密。\n不過……我倒是很想聽聽你的故事。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "別忘了我們的交易。\n我提供情報，你提供NEO病毒。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "我的任務？\n這個嘛……應該跟你差不多吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "喂，你相信我嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "想知道我聽命於誰？\n你應該知道你是不可能從我嘴裡套出什麼話的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "我討厭被別人牽著鼻子走……\n不過我就給你個機會吧。\n所以……你想聊什麼？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "我會在這裡等著你。\n別擔心，我哪都不會去，我會一直待在這裡。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "那東西……就藏在那個抽屜裡吧？\n你真的放心嗎？留我一個人在這裡。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "那就是D經營的飯店嗎？\n還要隱瞞身分暗中行動，真累人啊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "這裡看起來還算風平浪靜。\n只是誰也不知道暗地裡正在發生什麼事……",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "教堂？密碼鎖在哪裡？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "……我是艾達。既然我們現在有共同的目標，\n那就暫時請多關照了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "我想確認是不是真的變得更強了，\n陪我出去活動一下筋骨如何？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "托你的福，已改造完畢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "可以繼續執行任務了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "咦？這是什麼意思？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "你也太沒原則了吧？\n好吧，我就姑且收下了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "就算你送我禮物，我也不會改變交易條件的。\n至於我對你的觀感，又是另一回事了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "這世界似乎也沒那麼糟嘛。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "我知道。你是個好人，我喜歡你這一點。\n……跟他還真像呢。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "我們似乎比想像中還要有默契呢。\n你覺得呢？",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "你好像需要我的幫助？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "帶路吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "馬上出發。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "你懂的，我只做好份內工作。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "大家各司其職。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "不要掉以輕心。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "我會配合你的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "換彈。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "就先交給你了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "這些傢伙真難纏。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "發現目標。要處理掉嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "這會是精彩的一擊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "該結束這場戰鬥了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "有點膩了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "真有一套！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "我這邊搞定了，你那邊呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "唔。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "咳。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "呃。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "這……不是我想要的結局……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "做得不錯。下次任務也請多多指教囉。",
      "animation": "idle"
    }
  ]
}